 "about": "A flooded reservoir under the ground, the same from every side but for its colours: 46 m square under brick vaults on 36 marble columns. The tank (y 0), ankle deep, the sword on a stepped dais in its middle under the great oculus, the shotguns, the overshield and the camo out in the water. The quay (y 1.8) round the walls, where everyone spawns, steps down each side. The bridges (y 5.2): four arms over the water to a ring round the oculus' shaft, up by stairs along the walls or by a lift from the tank beside each arm; drop through the ring to the sword.",
